to spend within your means

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.380
but now you really have to.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:13.730
So there are some benefits right now,

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.880
I mean interest rates are about zero.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:20.510
So if you don't run up a
deficit on your credit card,

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:23.970
if you can try to live within your means,

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:25.580
that really helps.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.460
I would put off big purchases
