on a relative basis.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:53.313
So I guess what I would say is,

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:58.280
try to live within your means,

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:01.380
don't make big purchases
if you can help it.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:04.210
We all are traveling less,

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.950
so our gas bills should be down,

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:07.980
obviously oil prices are down.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:12.980
And I think just try to be
prudent with the decisions

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.823
you make in the short term.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.470
- Yeah, and what Anne is referring to,

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:18.400
we've had a partnership,

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.233
you know we've both alluded

00:14:19.233 --> 00:14:21.580
