00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:23.620
for I think it's seven or eight years now.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:27.130
Where back in 2010, 2011,
and this when Khan Academy

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.630
was a very small organization,

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:31.550
so I give Bank of America a lot of credit,

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.490
where they said, "You know we
really want to educate folks."

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:35.870
And I remember those first conversations

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:37.640
with Anne and her team.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.830
You know we were a little
suspicious of you frankly.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.613
You know big bank,
we're the small startup.

00:14:44.578 --> 00:14:46.137
And we said, "Well, you know

00:14:46.137 --> 00:14:47.440
"we wanna have editorial freedom."

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.620
