00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:51.630
And so we got into that partnership

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.660
around Better Money Habits
and just financial literacy,

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.763
'cause I think both sides of us think

00:14:54.763 --> 00:14:56.310
