part of that school system,

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.880
alongside algebra, and American history,

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.270
and everything else.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.620
But I have to say, Anne,
you know this has been

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:08.910
a really, and I don't
think I've actually had

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.160
a chance to tell you this,

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:13.810
I mean the partnership has kind
of given me a lot of faith.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.770
In that, a lot of the
stereotypes folks have

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.740
about, "Oh, you know big companies."

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:20.017
'Cause from day one y'all have just said,

00:15:20.017 --> 00:15:22.380
"Well, what do you think
is right to tell students?"

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:26.520
And you know, in our stuff
that we publish together

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.803
we talk about things,
some of the same things

00:15:27.803 --> 00:15:29.080
that you just alluded to,

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.960
like pay off your credit card
debt as soon as possible,

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:34.100
try to pay off your high
interest rate type of things,

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.810
you know leverage your
401K, if there's a match,

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.100
and all of that type of thing.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:41.100
And this isn't always in the, so to speak,

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.870
financial interest of
financial institutions.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:45.540
But it's because y'all see yourselves

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.340
as such major actors
for society generally,

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.270
that y'all want this
information out there.

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:53.450
And you know I found that very rewarding,

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:56.260
that at no point did we
feel that we're in some way

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.950
feeling held back in our openness

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.860
in making sure we're empowering folks.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.280
So that I think has been great.

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:03.460
And so for anyone who's curious,

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.980
