00:16:37.613 --> 00:16:38.830
How did you end up becoming,

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.870
you know one of the
leaders, the top leaders,

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.653
in the financial sector globally?

00:16:45.898 --> 00:16:47.970
- It took a long time (laughs).

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:50.920
So you know what, I wanna
